# the shadows. Almost nothing: a slow heartbeat, a pad that won't resolve,
# a few high notes like someone else's light far off. B minor, mostly not.
tempo 56
rows 4

inst beat  sine     vol 0.24 attack 0.005 decay 0.3 sustain 0.0
inst pad   sine     vol 0.10 attack 1.5 decay 1.0 sustain 0.8 release 2.0 vibrato 0.006
inst star  triangle vol 0.07 attack 0.002 decay 2.0 sustain 0.0

pattern a
beat  B1 .  B1 .  | .  .  .  .  | B1 .  B1 .  | .  .  .  .
pad   D4 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .
star  .  .  .  .  | F#6 . .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .

pattern b
beat  G1 .  G1 .  | .  .  .  .  | G1 .  G1 .  | .  .  .  .
pad   E4 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  -
star  .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | D6 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .

pattern c
beat  A#1 . A#1 . | .  .  .  .  | A#1 . A#1 . | .  .  .  .
pad   C#4 . .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .
star  .  .  C#6 . | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | B5 .  .  .

order a b a c a b c a
